{"intent": "clarify", "mode": "source-backed clarification", "message": "IPEDS has no \"women's college\" flag. How should we identify them?\n\n**A. No men enrolled (all students)**\n\nCount US Title IV institutions whose total fall 2024 enrollment (all students) includes zero men and at least one woman.\n\nProxy: IPEDS has no women's-college designation. Fall 2024 enrollment, all levels combined. Counts institutions that report zero men, which may include tiny or specialized schools that are not women's colleges, and excludes women's colleges that enroll a few men (e.g. graduate or non-degree students). Institutions with missing enrollment are excluded; the count is a proxy, not an official list.\n\n**B. No men among undergraduates**\n\nCount US Title IV institutions whose fall 2024 undergraduate enrollment includes zero men and at least one woman, allowing co-ed graduate programs.\n\nProxy: IPEDS has no women's-college designation. Fall 2024 undergraduate enrollment only; graduate programs may enroll men. Better fits traditional women's colleges with co-ed graduate programs, but may include small or specialized undergraduate programs that are not women's colleges. Institutions with missing undergraduate enrollment are excluded.", "model_usage": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "calls": 7, "planning_tool_requests": 12, "semantic_repair_attempts": 0, "latency_seconds": 36.391, "input_tokens": 193769, "output_tokens": 3219, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 15642, "cache_read_input_tokens": 93852, "estimated_api_usd": 0.46821820000000003, "pricing_basis": "Existing configured standard token-cost estimate; catalog planning may require multiple calls."}, "latency": {"reviewed_or_discovery_pipeline_seconds": 45.724010700010695, "answer_ready_seconds": 45.741586399963126, "live_model_calls": 7, "scope": "Server answer ready; browser rendering and download serialization measured separately in the test harness.", "conversation_resolution_seconds": 0}}
